158.content:
**Strong moments** — `Moments.add(ctx, path, MomentSpec)` describes a scene on one time line (columns of light, glowing ground
pattern, sky sigil, scene light, flash, shock wave, shake, embers, cinema camera, comm-channel HUD, sounds) with the mod's own looks;
`Moments.play(level, id, at, ...)` on the server sends one small packet, every client plays it by itself.

1092.content:
Every piece has its role, a strong side and a real drawback. Weapons grow with mastery (experience for foes slain);
hold G over a piece for the details. Bows (the Comet Bow, the String Bow) take the enchantments of the game's bow — Power,
Punch, Flame, Infinity — not those of a sword.
